WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:05.500
Chu Huan, have no hesitation—hack our way out! I will enter the palace and confront His Majesty myself!

00:06.240 --> 00:07.000
One!

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
Shield His Highness and break through the encirclement!

00:39.640 --> 00:43.000
General Zu Yue, listen to my explanation!
